 * Component designer-config v1: config.yml with defaults from the jar, validation and CLAMPING to the design caps (a
 * hand-edited value can never exceed what the validator allows), and a migration hook: when the jar's config_version is
 * newer than the server's file (the design's parameters were edited in Cyrus), every value under "items" is reset to the
