 * PlayerInteractEvent, which Bukkit delivers already "cancelled" for right-clicks in the air: there the item-use
 * result is checked instead (DENY = another plugin blocked it). The two handlers that ADD items (loot, mob drops) run at
 * NORMAL. Nothing here cancels another plugin's event.
